#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_author.rst:5
msgid "Element author and license"
msgstr "要素作者和许可证"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_author.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to define the author and the desired "
"license from the `element`_."
msgstr "QElectroTech提供了定义作者和从 `元件 <element_>`_ 想要的许可证的选项。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_author.rst:12
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech author and license element PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 作者和许可元素弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_author.rst:14
msgid ""
"The author and the license from an `element`_ cannot be displayed at the "
"`main window`_ from QElectroTech, this information can only be found from "
"`element editor`_."
msgstr ""
"在QElectroTech的 `元件 <element_>`_ 上无法显示作者和 `元素 <main window_>`_ 的许可证，此信息只能从 "
"`元素编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 中找到。"

#: ../../source/users/element/properties/element_author.rst:19
msgid ""
"For more information about how to find the license and author from an "
"`element`_, refer to `define author element information`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于如何从 `元件 <element_>`_ 中找到许可证和作者的更多信息，参见 `定义作者元素信息 <define author element "
"information_>`_ 节。"
